            <h2 style="page-break-before:always" class="qz-heading qz-heading-level-1">
                <span class="qz-heading-number">1</span>Executive Summary
            </h2>
            <h3 style="" class="qz-heading qz-heading-level-2">
                <span class="qz-heading-number">1.1</span>Objective of the Document
            </h3>
            <p style="text-align:justify">
                <span t-field="doc.partner_id.name"/>
                is requesting a proposal for the provision and deployment of a business management system, enabling them
                to oversee, monitor, track and control all business operations.
            </p>
            <p style="text-align:justify">The business management system should be user-friendly with an intuitive web
                application that can be used on Windows, iOS and android. Employees should be able to handle any kind of
                administrative request easily and in an efficient manner. The database must be safeguarded with the
                highest security standards (technical and role-wise) and all data should be interpreted on a
                comprehensive dashboard to empower human resources management.
            </p>
            <h3 style="" class="qz-heading qz-heading-level-2">
                <span class="qz-heading-number">1.2</span>Solution Overview
            </h3>
            <h4 style=";font-weight:300;color:#1f3763" class="qz-heading qz-heading-level-3">
                <span class="qz-heading-number">1.2.1</span>Project Implementation Overview
            </h4>
            <div class="qz-editable" t-out="doc._qz_document_html('qz_implementation_overview')"/>
            <p style="text-align:justify">
                <span t-field="doc.company_id.name"/>
                will deliver a fully operational management system that will be configured, tested, loaded, and
                operationally ready in line with the project milestones and in accordance with the requirements and
                statutory regulations.
            </p>
            <p style="text-align:justify">The delivered system will be scalable, real‐time, interoperable and will
                support different protocols. It will ensure data security and will have a design resilience in case of
                failures.
            </p>
            <p style="text-align:justify">
                <span t-field="doc.company_id.name"/>
                will deliver the required features (both functional and non‐functional), which will provide smart and
                intelligent outcomes with enhanced operational efficiency.
            </p>
            <h2 style="page-break-before:always" class="qz-heading qz-heading-level-1">
                <span class="qz-heading-number">2</span>Corporate Identity
            </h2>
            <h3 style="" class="qz-heading qz-heading-level-2">
                <span class="qz-heading-number">2.1</span>
                <span t-field="doc.company_id.name"/>
            </h3>
            <p style="text-align:justify">
                <span t-field="doc.company_id.name"/>
                is a regional software provider that brings a decade of leadership and innovation combined in Enterprise
                Resource Planning, Mobile Applications, and Digital Transformation Solutions.
            </p>
            <p style="text-align:justify">With its distinctive knowledge in advanced technology and conducted by its
                microservices architecture,
                <span t-field="doc.company_id.name"/>
                emphasizes covering all business needs related to various sectors and industries such as:
            </p>
            <ul class="qz-bullets">
                <li>Contracting</li>
                <li>Manufacturing</li>
                <li>Logistics</li>
                <li>Real Estate</li>
                <li>Retail</li>
                <li>Services</li>
                <li>Wholesale</li>
            </ul>
            <p style="text-align:justify">Through a well-planned service offering portfolio, we work on generating
                specific business solutions while combining cutting-edge innovations such as AI, IoT, and machine
                learning.
            </p>
            <p style="text-align:justify">With offices located in Dubai and with years of expertise,
                <span t-field="doc.company_id.name"/>
                managed to become a trusted leader in information governance supported by an ever-increasing legal and
                compliant environment.
            </p>
            <h4 style="page-break-before:always;font-weight:300;color:#1f3763" class="qz-heading qz-heading-level-3">
                <span class="qz-heading-number">2.1.1</span>
                <span t-field="doc.company_id.name"/>
                Client References
            </h4>
            <div class="qz-editable qz-client-references" t-field="doc.qz_client_references_html"/>
            <style>.qz-client-references img { max-width:100%; height:auto; }</style>
            <h2 style="page-break-before:always" class="qz-heading qz-heading-level-1">
                <span class="qz-heading-number">3</span>Proposed Solution Details and Scope
            </h2>
            <div class="qz-editable" t-out="doc._qz_document_html('qz_propsed_solution_details')"/>
            <h3 style="" class="qz-heading qz-heading-level-2">
                <span class="qz-heading-number">3.1</span>Odoo Implementation Scope
            </h3>
            <p style="font-weight:700">Business:
                <span t-field="doc.qz_business_description"/>
            </p>
            <p style="font-weight:700">Solution Type:
                <span t-field="doc.sale_order_template_id"/>
            </p>
            <h4 class="qz-heading qz-heading-level-3" style=";font-weight:300;color:#1f3763">
                <span class="qz-heading-number">3.1.1</span>MODULES
            </h4>
