                <span class="qz-heading-number">4</span>Project Implementation Approach
            </h2>
            <h3 style="" class="qz-heading qz-heading-level-2">
                <span class="qz-heading-number">4.1</span>Professional Services Overview
            </h3>
            <p style="text-align:justify">A turnkey solution that includes software licenses, installation,
                implementation and after sales support will be offered by<span t-field="doc.company_id.name"/>.
            </p>
            <p style="text-align:justify">
                <span t-field="doc.company_id.name"/>
                will provide necessary manpower to carry out this project covering the following services:
            </p>
            <ul class="qz-bullets">
                <li>Licensing and hosting</li>
                <li>Business Requirements and Consultancy</li>
                <li>Solution Architecture</li>
                <li>Configuration</li>
                <li>Customizations agreed in the scope</li>
                <li>Deployment</li>
                <li>Testing and Quality Assurance/Control</li>
                <li>Training and Documentation</li>
                <li>Support and Companionship</li>
                <li>1 month free of charge including companionship after go-live.</li>
                <li>Yearly paid support and maintenance contract upon the companionship phase completion.</li>
            </ul>
